<% content_for :title, "Reservi — Turn conversations into completed work" %>
<% content_for :main_class, "w-full py-0" %>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-stone-900 px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
      Every conversation deserves<br>to become a completed job
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-stone-300">
      Reservi is a conversation-centric CRM built for teams that turn
      customer requests into real work — without the busywork.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <%= link_to "Start free", register_path, class: "rounded-md bg-emerald-600 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-emerald-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-emerald-400" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_path, class: "rounded-md px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-stone-300 hover:text-white" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Value props -->
<section class="bg-white px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl">
      Your inbox is your process
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-center text-lg leading-8 text-stone-500">
      Reservi treats every customer conversation as a running process — not a
      pile of records that someone has to keep updated.
    </p>

    <dl class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Inbox-first</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Reply, claim, add notes — everything lives inside a shared conversation workspace. No tabs, no hunting.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Configurable stages</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Define what needs to happen at each step. Fields to collect, catalogs to pick from, appointments to schedule — all configurable.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Deterministic automation</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Rules assign, route, and react to state. No black-box AI making unexplained decisions. Every action is explainable.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Shared human + AI workspace</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Your team and AI agents operate on the same conversation, stage, and facts. Same truth, same tools.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Services, cars, properties — one model</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Everything you offer is a Catalog Item. You don't need a different workflow for your rentals, services, and treatments.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Appointments independent of items</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Schedule a viewing, a pickup, a consultation — with or without a selected item. The conversation provides the context.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How it works -->
<section class="bg-stone-50 px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl">
      How it works
    </h2>

    <ol class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-12 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="relative">
        <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-900 text-sm font-semibold text-white">1</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Configure your flow</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Define stages with blocks, fields, catalogs, and appointments. Set rules that fire automatically when conditions are met.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="relative">
        <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-900 text-sm font-semibold text-white">2</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Inbox does the work</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Every conversation enters at the first stage. Reply, collect facts, select items, schedule appointments — all from one screen.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="relative">
        <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-900 text-sm font-semibold text-white">3</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Stages complete themselves</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">When a stage's requirements are met, the conversation advances. The CRM updates itself as a side effect of real work.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- For who -->
<section class="bg-white px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl">
      Built for teams that do real work
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-center text-lg leading-8 text-stone-500">
      Service providers, rental operators, property managers, clinics, and
      agencies — if you turn conversations into outcomes, Reservi is your
      operating system.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Service businesses</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Gardeners, cleaners, tutors, consultants. Collect requirements via fields, let customers pick from your catalog, schedule appointments — all in one flow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Rental &amp; property</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Cars, villas, equipment, treatment rooms. Every item is a Catalog entry. Every booking starts as a conversation with a real timeline.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Clinics &amp; wellness</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Patient intake, treatment selection, follow-up scheduling. Configurable stages that match your real clinical workflow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Agencies &amp; teams</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Assignment rules, team routing, shared inbox. Your operators and AI agents work the same queue with the same tools.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="bg-stone-900 px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
      Move from conversations to completed work
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-stone-300">
      One workspace. Your team, your workflow, your customers. No busywork.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <%= link_to "Start free", register_path, class: "rounded-md bg-emerald-600 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-emerald-500" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="bg-stone-950 px-6 py-8 text-center text-sm text-stone-500">
  <p>&copy; <%= Date.today.year %> Reservi. Every conversation deserves to become a completed job.</p>
</footer>